OL,3,GNEWSATown's schools closed after water
OL,4,Amain bursts
OL,5,
OL,6,FA burst water main has resulted in the
OL,7,Fclosure of two schools and affected up
OL,8,Fto 3,000 homes.
OL,10,FVista Academy and Littleport Community
OL,11,FPrimary School, both in Littleport
OL,12,FCambridgeshire, closed towards the
OL,13,Fbeginning of the school day and sent
OL,14,Fpupils home.
OL,16,FAn Anglian Water spokesperson
OL,17,Fapologised and said the burst main
OL,18,Foccurred at about 01:00 BST, but most
OL,19,Fpeople began to be affected from 11:00.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
