OL,3,GNEWSATown's schools closed after water
OL,4,Amain bursts
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe company, which has delivered
OL,7,Fbottled water to customers on its
OL,8,Fpriority services register, said a
OL,9,Fspecialist digger was now on site and
OL,10,Fwork has begun to repair the main.
